"A game in which a subgame-perfect Nash equilibrium fails sequential rationality. The profile in
which Player 1 plays A and Player 2 plays r is a Nash equilibrium, and since there are no proper
subgames it is subgame perfect. But whatever Player 2 believes about whether Player 1 chose L or
R, Player 2 does better by choosing l, and anticipating this Player 1 chooses L."

